'''Stormwrought Castle''' are the ruins of the former seat of power of the Balor family, destroyed when [[Balor]] was taken by the [[Old Horde]] during the [[Second War]] and now occupied by the orcs of the [[Stormreaver clan]] and their masters of the [[Shadow Council]]. A now-ruined monument to [[Daria Balor]] stands prominently in the center of the courtyard.

The entrance to the [[Stormwrought Ruins]] dungeon is located here, accessed by climbing up a siege tower to the castle's ramparts.

